#. translators: Warning notice in the WordPress admin. "WPML Multilingual for BuddyPress and BuddyBoss" is the name of this plugin and stays in English; "profile fields" are the BuddyPress member profile fields.
#: includes/class.xprofile.php:722
msgid "WPML Multilingual for BuddyPress and BuddyBoss: some profile fields are not registered for translation"
msgstr "WPML Multilingual for BuddyPress and BuddyBoss: niektóre pola profilu nie są zarejestrowane do tłumaczenia"

#. translators: Button inside the "some profile fields are not registered for translation" notice; it registers those fields for translation. Verb, imperative.
#: includes/class.xprofile.php:727
msgid "Register fields"
msgstr "Zarejestruj pola"

#. translators: Confirmation shown in the WordPress admin after the "Register fields" button has run. A statement about what happened, not an instruction.
#: includes/class.xprofile.php:736
msgid "Fields registered"
msgstr "Zarejestrowano pola"

#. translators: Warning notice shown in the WordPress admin when a plugin this one needs is missing. %1$s: opening link tag, %2$s: closing link tag; the link opens WPML's documentation. Every product name stays in English.
#: includes/functions.php:81
#, php-format
msgid "To use WPML Multilingual for BuddyPress and BuddyBoss, enable the WPML Multilingual CMS plugin and %1$sString Translation add-on%2$s alongside BuddyPress or BuddyBoss."
msgstr "Aby korzystać z WPML Multilingual for BuddyPress and BuddyBoss, włącz wtyczkę WPML Multilingual CMS oraz %1$sdodatek String Translation%2$s wraz z BuddyPress lub BuddyBoss."

#. translators: Warning notice shown in the WordPress admin when the site's language URL format is not the one this plugin needs. "Different languages in directories" is an option, and "WPML > Languages > Language URL Format" a path through the WordPress admin: both should read as those screens are named in this language.
#: includes/functions.php:91
msgid "For WPML Multilingual for BuddyPress and BuddyBoss to work you must set \"Different languages in directories\" in WPML > Languages > Language URL Format"
msgstr "Aby wtyczka WPML Multilingual for BuddyPress and BuddyBoss działała poprawnie, musisz wybrać opcję „Różne języki w katalogach” w sekcji WPML > Języki > Format URL języka"
